    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would result in an excessively bulky, visually intrusive and domineering form of development that would subsume the character of the original dwelling. The proposal would result in significant harm to the character and appearance of the local area and streetscene in this prominent location. The proposal would be wholly unacceptable in design terms and would be contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 and Part A5, Residential Extension Guidelines contained within the adopted Character, Sustainability and Design Codes Supplementary Planning Document. ",
